OL,3,GNEWSACoast to coast passport scheme
OL,4,Acelebrates growth
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlmost a third of hikers on a famous
OL,7,Fcoast to coast walk between Cumbria and
OL,8,FNorth Yorkshire now take part in a
OL,9,Fscheme encouraging them to spend money
OL,10,Fin communities along the route, its
OL,11,Forganisers have said.
OL,13,FThe "passport" scheme on the 190-mile
OL,14,F(305km) walk, from St Bees Head to
OL,15,FRobin Hood's Bay, was launched by
OL,16,FRichmond Yorkshire Community Interest
OL,17,FCompany (CIC) in May 2025.
OL,19,FIt encourages participants to collect
OL,20,Fstamps in their passports by using
OL,21,Fshops, pubs and visitor attractions
OL,22,Falong the route.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
